vent the transport of stuff across compartments.\")\n5862:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D012708\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000216 \"A supporting cell projecting inward from the basement membrane of seminiferous tubules. They surround and nourish the developing male germ cells and secrete androgen binding protein. Their tight junctions with the spermatogonia and spermatocytes provide a blood-testis barrier.\")\n5863:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"BTO:0001238\")\n5864:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"CALOHA:TS-0922\")\n5865:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"FMA:72298\")\n5866:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000216 \"VHOG:0001348\")\n5882:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:cvs\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D012583\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000218 \"A neuroglial cell of the peripheral nervous system which forms the insulating myelin sheaths of peripheral axons.\")\n5883:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"Schwann cell\")\n5884:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"peripheral neuroglial cell\")\n5885:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000218 \"CALOHA:TS-0898\")\n5886:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000218 \"FMA:62121\")\n5887:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000218 \"neurilemmal cell\")\n5895:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"FB:ma\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000219 \"A cell that moves by its own activities.\")\n5901:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0000000\")\n5902:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0000003\")\n5903:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider obo:CL_0000220 \"CL:0001034\")\n5910:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"MESH:D004475\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000221 \"A cell of the outer of the three germ l