yte\")\n10536:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000776 \"immature neutrocyte\")\n10537:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000776 \"immature neutrophil leucocyte\")\n10538:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000776 \"immature neutrophil leukocyte\")\n10539:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000776 \"immature neutrophilic leucocyte\")\n10547:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0702022918\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:3540536663\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:1600140\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16146841\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000777 \"A tissue-resident macrophage of the renal glomerular mesangium involved in the disposal and degradation of filtration residues, presentation of antigen to T cells and in tissue remodeling.\")\n10548:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0000777 \"mesangial cell\")\n10555:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12713016\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:15055519\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:17380158\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:9415452\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000778 \"A specialized mononuclear osteoclast associated with the absorption and removal of bone, precursor of multinuclear osteoclasts.\")\n10563:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12713016\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29379067\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38903088\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:9415452\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000779 \"A specialized multinuclear osteoclast, forming a syncytium through the fusion of mononuclear precursor cells, associated with the absorption and removal of bone.\")\n10564:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOw