ositive and CD21-positive, and found in the B cell follicles of the white pulp of the spleen or the corticol areas of the peripheral lymph nodes. This cell type is also described as being CD19-positive, B220-positive, AA4-negative, CD43-negative, and CD5-negative.\")\n11381:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000843 \"Fo B cell\")\n11382:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000843 \"Fo B-cell\")\n11383:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000843 \"follicular B lymphocyte\")\n11384:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000843 \"follicular B-cell\")\n11385:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000843 \"follicular B-lymphocyte\")\n11393:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:dsd\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0781735149\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:19447676\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20933013\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000844 \"A rapidly cycling mature B cell that has distinct phenotypic characteristics and is involved in T-dependent immune responses and located typically in the germinal centers of lymph nodes. This cell type expresses Ly77 after activation.\")\n11394:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"GC B cell\")\n11395:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"GC B lymphocyte\")\n11396:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"GC B-cell\")\n11397:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"GC B-lymphocyte\")\n11398:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"germinal center B lymphocyte\")\n11399:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"germinal center B-cell\")\n11400:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000844 \"germinal center B-lymphocyte\")\n11409:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:add\") Ann