hich the apical ending of the dendrite is a pronounced ciliated olfactory knob.\")\n11434:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000847 \"ciliated olfactory sensory neuron\")\n11435:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000847 \"ciliated sensory neuron\")\n11441:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16841163\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000848 \"An olfactory receptor cell in which the apical ending of the dendrite is a knob that bears numerous microvilli.\")\n11442:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000848 \"microvillous olfactory sensory neuron\")\n11443:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0000848 \"microvillous sensory neuron\")\n11449:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:16841163\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000849 \"An olfactory receptor cell with short cilia growing in an invagination bordered by microvilli.\")\n11450:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000849 \"crypt cell\")\n11451:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000849 \"crypt olfactory sensory neuron\")\n11452:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000849 \"crypt sensory neuron\")\n11458:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"SANBI:mhl\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000850 \"A neuron that releases serotonin as a neurotransmitter.\")\n11459:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000850 \"MESH:D059326\")\n11460:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000850 \"WBbt:0006837\")\n11461:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000850 \"5-HT neuron\")\n11462:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000850 \"5-hydroxytryptamine neuron\")\n11463:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0000850 \"serotinergic neuron\")\n11470:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0125296509\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000851 \"Neuromast mantle cell is a non-sensory cell. Neuromast mantle cells surround the neuromast support cells and neuromast hair cells, separating the neuromast from the epidermis, and secrete cupula in which the ciliary bundles of all the hair cells are embedded.\")\n11478:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0125296509\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000852 \"Neuromast support cell is a non-sensory cell of the neuromast that extend between the sensory hair cells from the basement membrane to the apical surface; neuromast support cells are surrounded by neuromast mantle cells.\")\n11479:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000852 \"neuromast support cell\")\n11487:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0517223651\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"SANBI:mhl\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000853 \"Olfactory epithelial support cell is a columnar cell that extends from the epithelial free margin to the basement membrane of the olfactory epithelium. This cell type has a large, vertically, elongate, euchromatic nucleus, along with other nuclei, forms a layer superficial to the cell body of the receptor cell; sends long somewhat irregular microvilli into the mucus layer; at the base, with expanded end-feet containing numerous lamellated dense bodies resembling lipofuscin of neurons.\")\n11488:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000853 \"FMA:62302\")\n11489:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000853 \"olfactory epithelial support cell\")\n11490:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000853 \"olfactory sustentacular cell\")\n11491:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000853 \"supporting cell of olfactory epithelium\")\n11492:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0000853 \"sustentaculocyte of olfactory epithelium\")\n11500:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"SANBI:mhl\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000854 \"Interneuromast cell is a neuroectodermal cell deposited by the migrating lateral line