ized architecture. It plays an essential role in regulating motor coordination and potentially cognitive functions.\")\n29318:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_2000027 \"cerebellum basket cell\")\n29321:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1016/j.cnp.2022.11.002\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_2000027 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/CB_circuits_PMID3650468_f2.png>)\n29322:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.3389/fnins.2020.00293\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_2000027 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/Candelabrum_cell.png>)\n29328:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000028 \"Any glutamatergic neuron that is part of a cerebellum.\")\n29337:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000029 \"Any neuron that is part of a central nervous system.\")\n29346:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000030 \"Any native cell that is part of a hypothalamus.\")\n29355:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000031 \"Any neuron that is part of a lateral line ganglion.\")\n29365:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0721662544\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000032 \"A neuron that is part of a peripheral nervous system.\")\n29368:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_2000032 \"FMA:84664\")\n29369:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_2000032 \"PNS neuron\")\n29370:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_2000032 \"peripheral neuron\")\n29377:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:TermGenie\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_2000033 \"Any basal cell of ep