udes CA4 (which could be considered part of the dentate gyrus) in Uberon, hence no equivalent class axiom was made.\")\n30770:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"DOI:10.1101/2022.10.12.511898\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023061 \"A neuron that has its soma located in CA4 of the hippocampus.\")\n30778:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023062 \"A neuron with its soma located in the dentate gyrus of the hippocampus.\")\n30785:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4023063 \"MGE interneuron\")\n30786:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"DOI:10.1101/2022.10.12.511898\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023063 \"An interneuron that is derived from the medial ganglionic eminence.\")\n30788:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4023063 \"MGE interneuron\")\n30794:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4023064 \"CGE interneuron\")\n30795:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20130169\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824663\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4023064 \"An interneuron that is derived from the caudal ganglionic eminence.\")\n30797:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20130169\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4023064 \"caudal ganglionic eminence derived GABAergic interneuron\")\n30798:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:20130169\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4023064 \"CGE interneuron\")\n30799:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824663\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4023064 \"CGE interneuron\")\n30800:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27034423\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4023064 \"CGE-derived GABAergic IN\")\n30801:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:27034423\") 